    "detailed_description": "<strong>Aksiyon dolu inan\u0131lmaz maceralara haz\u0131r m\u0131s\u0131n ?</strong><br><br>Karakterinizi tam olarak yaratt\u0131ktan sonra hi\u00e7 zaman kaybetmeden <strong>Warhaos</strong>\u2019un inan\u0131lmaz d\u00fcnyas\u0131na atlayabiliriz. <br><br>\u015eimdi tipik bir MMORPG\u2019de de rastlayaca\u011f\u0131n\u0131z gibi yarat\u0131klar\u0131 keserek, g\u00f6revleri tamamlayarak ve deneyim kazanarak epik ser\u00fcvenimizi yazma zaman\u0131!<br><br><strong>Warhaos</strong> \u015fu an oynan\u0131labilir ve geli\u015ftirme a\u015famas\u0131ndad\u0131r.<br><br><strong>Bu Durumda;</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Hikaye Ve Kurgu De\u011fi\u015febilir.<br></li><li> B\u00f6l\u00fcm tasar\u0131m\u0131 (Level Design) de\u011fi\u015febilir.<br></li><li> Aray\u00fcz ve men\u00fcler de\u011fi\u015febilir.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Beta S\u00fcr\u00fcm i\u00e7in Planlanan \u00f6zellikler:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Karakter Olu\u015fturma.<br></li><li> Basit Skill sistemi.<br></li><li> Karakter i\u00e7in stat\u00fc puanlar\u0131<br></li><li> Level Sistemi<br></li><li> Multiplayer Oyuncular.<br></li><li> Sohbet alan\u0131.<br></li><li> Npc'ler (Demirci, I\u015f\u0131nlay\u0131c\u0131, Sat\u0131c\u0131)<br></li><li> Envanter<br></li><li> Haritalar (Tardord, Tarness, Tarduous)<br></li><li> Yarat\u0131klar<br></li><li> Loot Sistemi</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1516920/extras/87b231cb5516351c4bca73f439d8eeae.avif?t=1625081725\" /></div>",
